abstract: "EliteAEO is an independent ranking and research publisher covering AEO, GEO and AI SEO agencies and consultants. Founded in 2026 and based in West Palm Beach, Florida, EliteAEO publishes evidence-checked provider rankings, its methodology, market data and AI visibility research. It does not sell AEO or SEO services."
